whole thing could have been prevented. <br>\n<span class=strong>Adam:</span> I'm just going to leave now, I'll come back later. <br>\n<span class=strong>Denise:</span> What's going on? Adam, where are you off to?<br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> They're just bickering ... like usual.", "id": 0, "image": ""}, {"time": "40200", "text": "<span class=strong>Denise:</span> Gentlemen, I'm going to grab something from the boardroom. By the time I get back, I hope this bickering will have stopped. <br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> You'll have to go the boardroom a few times before that happens. <br>\n<span class=strong>Boris:</span> Denise, it was going well until we arrived at the hotel. <br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Then what happened?<br>\n<span class=strong>Boris:</span> It just went downhill from there. <br>\n<span class=strong>Adam:</span> You could have told me about the reservation. <br>\n<span class=strong>Denise:</span> What about the reservation? I thought you had taken care of that before you left, Boris.<br>\n<span class=strong>Boris: </span> So had I, but it wasn't. I should have double-checked with my assistant. I was under the assumption reservations had been made, but unfortunately when we arrived at the hotel, they told us there was no reservation under either of our names!", "id": 1, "image": ""}, {"time": "79750", "text": "<span class=strong>Adam:</span> Ah, the embarrassment! I was mortified! How could you have forgotten to do that, Boris? Such a simple thing ... <br>\n<span class=strong>Boris:</span> Oh, Adam ... that was nothing in comparison to your run-in with Martina as we were leaving. <br>\n<span class=strong>Denise and Kristi:</span> Martina? <br>\n<span class=strong>Kristi:</span> Who's that, Adam?<br>\n<span class=strong>Boris:</span> He will not tell you. Let's just say, there was a lot of confusion. She was baffled!<br>\n<span class=strong>Adam:</span> I'd rather not comment on that. Things could have been completely different if Boris had been more organized!", "id": 2, "image": ""}], "video_src": "engenn11le12ob09re2vid01"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "video", "id": 2, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}